  "description": "Water recovery and management: collects humidity condensate, urine, and waste-handling wash water, then processes it through multifiltration beds and a catalytic reactor to potable quality. The ISS Water Recovery System achieves 93% water loop closure, reclaiming roughly 6,000 kg of water per year from crew metabolic and hygiene outputs, breaking the launch-mass dependency on resupplied water.",
